msgid "Power Monitor/Module Configuration in Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 中的电源监控器/模块配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:7
#: 40e56194e5f444519b78b2f0bb4d00df 6775747fba814e96bc379155f1ad5023
#: 810eab58b468411ea0c3b0a442e8d9e0 b4af8ba25e7b4fc8a8fea4e1010240a5
#: f159b2db46144b1fa525ffd92b9f4586
msgid ""
"Up to 16 battery monitors may be used in ArduPilot, with parameter groups "
"named BATT\\_ through BATT9\\_ for the first 10, and BATTA\\_ thru BATTF\\_ "
"for the last 6 monitors. For this article all parameter name references will"
" be shown for the first monitor, BATT\\_"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中最多可使用 16 个电池监控器，参数组名称从 BATT\\_ 到 BATT9\\_ 用于前 10 个，BATTA\\_ 到 "
"BATTF\\_ 用于后 6 个监控器。本文中所有参数名称均以第一个监控器 BATT\\_ 为例进行说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:9
#: 3ffdadb86b754ba988bc38dafe11d65c a8940dad6616480eb2eee84100c518b3
#: b6fd0bec8f3144e2b0348188252a94d1 bb6c5320debd4440a68eec215f61a3d0
#: d1247d78cddb4863b57721bc5fcfa790
msgid ""
"A power monitor can be used to measure the battery voltage and current for "
"use in the battery failsafe and a power module can also provide a stable "
"power supply to the autopilot."
msgstr "电源监控器可用于测量电池电压和电流，供电池失控保护使用；电源模块还可以为飞控提供稳定的电源。"

