#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:18
#: 05c0fae1746040c5b285338bc0d8ff23 1ad5f50aee7b4c2683f0944930dd6f8c
#: 9dda8ce5249847baab4c6f83b53aa161 cae530a72bf143b2b2af18ad4752cecb
#: cb7197b4c9844657af66b24f00e40a5b
msgid ""
"Battery measurement is primarily set up in the *Mission Planner*'s **INITIAL"
" SETUP \\| Optional Hardware \\| Battery Monitor** screen. Note that "
"currently Mission Planner only supports the first two Battery Monitors in "
"the system (a total of 10 are available in firmware versions 4.0 and later)."
" More would need to be configured directly by directly setting their "
"parameters in the **CONFIG/TUNING\\|Full Parameter List** screen."
msgstr ""
"电池测量主要在 *Mission Planner* 的 **INITIAL SETUP \\| Optional Hardware \\| "
"Battery Monitor** 界面中设置。请注意，目前 Mission Planner 仅支持系统中的前两个电池监控器（固件 4.0 "
"及更高版本共提供 10 个）。更多监控器需要在 **CONFIG/TUNING\\|Full Parameter List** 界面中直接设置其参数。"

