msgid ""
"The **Sensor** selection list offers a number of analog Power Modules "
"(including popular models from 3DR and AttoPilot) which you can select to "
"automatically configure your module. If your PM is not on the list then you "
"can select **Other**, enter its recommended values, or :ref:`perform a "
"manual calibration <common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-"
"planner_calibration>` as described below."
msgstr ""
"**Sensor** 选择列表提供了多种模拟电源模块（包括 3DR 和 AttoPilot "
"的常见型号），可选择以自动配置您的模块。如果您的电源模块不在列表中，可以选择 **Other**，输入其推荐值，或按照下文说明 :ref:`进行手动校准"
" <common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner_calibration>`。"

