#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:95
#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:96
#: 2b18712493db48be82995f7531608286 59237ab6515643d9ae0d663b978d6fe8
