#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:100
#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:101
#: 3d0c6002e7054211bcfcf6d46125c674 71e3f9eee1804827bf6252b15f8dc19e
