msgstr "模拟监控器校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:102
#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:103
#: 343e34c8d1cb495b9b278b23e34fb02b 3f36415f754049179c997daccb94478a
