msgid ""
"Using the power analyser you can also measure the current and compare to "
"results displayed in the Mission Planner. You can also empirically adjust "
"the current scale and offset parameters as explained in :ref:`common-analog-"
"current-calibration`."
msgstr ""
"使用功率分析仪还可以测量电流并与 Mission Planner 中显示的结果对比。您也可以按照 :ref:`common-analog-"
"current-calibration` 中的说明，通过经验调整电流比例和偏移参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:139
#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:140
#: 06ee3f907ef546cfad0735f121398b33 16663f11355348598be57a79d1c4e193
#: 5c1ca575ce304c19b38ee6afaba3e813 aa1ef2d3b5e641789c036feee5c4bc53
#: d474f0365df04085b445d0c0b7a58763
msgid ""
"Most current sensors are not very accurate at low currents (less than 3 "
"Amps). Typically you should perform current calibration at around 10A. The "
"exception is PMs that use hall-effect sensors, like :ref:`those from Mauch "
"<common-mauch-power-modules>`."
msgstr ""
"大多数电流传感器在低电流（小于 3A）时精度不高。通常应在约 10A 时进行电流校准。使用霍尔效应传感器的电源模块（如 :ref:`Mauch "
"的电源模块 <common-mauch-power-modules>`）除外。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:143
