#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:84
#: 1ed4546530f54c6da600feeab41b2d3d 904f34125a074f5fa5747858ae96276e
#: 90e8470391364c5997271e68cb525909 d244ff4cddd9461e9b045bcb085dd698
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_OPTIONS<BATT_OPTIONS>` bit 0, if set, will ignore the State Of "
"Charge field in DroneCAN monitors, since some do not populate this field "
"with meaningful data. Also various options for MPPT type monitors are "
"provided. Bit 6 allows the resting voltage to be sent in place of battery "
"voltage, which is sometime more useful. Bit 7 allows the Battery Auxiliary "
"info from another DroneCAN monitor with the same "
":ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to be used for this monitor "
"instance. For Bit 9 if set, the Sum monitor type measures minimum voltage "
"instead of average. Bit 10 allows telemetry to conttinue if a DroneCAN "
"battery with a different id is hotswapped."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_OPTIONS<BATT_OPTIONS>` bit 0 若置位，将忽略 DroneCAN 监测器中的荷电状态（State Of "
"Charge）字段，因为有些监测器不会在该字段中填充有意义的数据。此外还提供了针对 MPPT 类型监测器的多种选项。Bit 6 "
"允许发送静息电压来代替电池电压，这有时更有用。Bit 7 允许将来自另一个具有相同 "
":ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 的 DroneCAN 监测器的电池辅助信息用于此监测器实例。Bit 9 "
"若置位，Sum 监测器类型测量最小电压而不是平均电压。Bit 10 允许在热插拔了 id 不同的 DroneCAN 电池时数传继续工作。"
